###

### List all requests
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests
Accept: application/json

###

### List requests – filter by estado
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests?status=received
Accept: application/json

###

### List requests – filter by tipo and prioridad
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests?type=technical_support&priority=high
Accept: application/json

###

### Get specific request – replace 64b4b2b9-9886-4818-92d7-d064abe96956 with a real UUID from POST response
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests/64b4b2b9-9886-4818-92d7-d064abe96956
Accept: application/json

###

### Get request – non-existent UUID (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###

### Update estado → en_proceso (replace 64b4b2b9-9886-4818-92d7-d064abe96956 with a real UUID)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests/64b4b2b9-9886-4818-92d7-d064abe96956/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

###

### Update estado → completada
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests/<external_id>/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

###

### Update estado – invalid value (422 Unprocessable Entity)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests/<external_id>/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "pendiente"
}
